政治・軍事","personName":"平清盛","cardTitle":"日宋貿易の覇王・平清盛","achievementText":"武士として初めて太政大臣となり、日宋貿易を進めた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/013.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/013.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"054","originalEra":"奈良時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"奈良","category":"文化・産業","personName":"行基","cardTitle":"民衆の導き手・行基","achievementText":"民衆に仏教を広め、東大寺の大仏造立にも協力した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/054.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/054.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"055","originalEra":"奈良時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"奈良","category":"文化・産業","personName":"鑑真","cardTitle":"盲目の伝道師・鑑真","achievementText":"何度もの失敗を乗り越えて来日し、正しい戒律を伝えた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/055.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/055.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"056","originalEra":"平安時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"平安","category":"文化・産業","personName":"最澄","cardTitle":"比叡山の聖火・最澄","achievementText":"唐で学び、比叡山延暦寺を開いて天台宗を広めた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/056.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/056.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"057","originalEra":"平安時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"平安","category":"文化・産業","personName":"空海","cardTitle":"密教の開祖・空海","achievementText":"唐で学び、高野山金剛峯寺を開いて真言宗を広めた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/057.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/057.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"058","originalEra":"平安時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"平安","category":"文化・産業","personName":"菅原道真","cardTitle":"雷神の怒り・菅原道真","achievementText":"遣唐使の停止を提案し、学問に優れた人物として知られる。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/058.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/058.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"059","originalEra":"平安時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"平安","category":"文化・産業","personName":"紫式部","cardTitle":"雅なる筆文字・紫式部","achievementText":"平安時代の貴族社会を描いた『源氏物語』を書いた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/059.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/059.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"060","originalEra":"平安時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"平安","category":"文化・産業","personName":"清少納言","cardTitle":"春はあけぼの・清少納言","achievementText":"宮中での生活や自然への感想を記した『枕草子』を書いた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/060.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/060.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"014","originalEra":"鎌倉時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"鎌倉","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"源頼朝","cardTitle":"武家政権の祖・源頼朝","achievementText":"鎌倉幕府を開き、守護と地頭を全国に置いた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/014.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/014.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"015","originalEra":"鎌倉時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"鎌倉","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"源義経","cardTitle":"悲劇の天才戦術家・源義経","achievementText":"壇ノ浦の戦いなどで平氏を滅ぼす大きな功績を立てた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/015.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/015.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"016","originalEra":"鎌倉時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"鎌倉","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"北条政子","cardTitle":"涙の演説・北条政子","achievementText":"承久の乱の際に御家人へ演説し、幕府の結束を強めた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/016.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/016.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"017","originalEra":"鎌倉時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"鎌倉","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"北条泰時","cardTitle":"御成敗式目の制定者・北条泰時","achievementText":"武士のための法律である御成敗式目を制定した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/017.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/017.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"018","originalEra":"鎌倉時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"鎌倉","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"後鳥羽上皇","cardTitle":"打倒幕府の執念・後鳥羽上皇","achievementText":"承久の乱を起こして鎌倉幕府を倒そうとした。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/018.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/018.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"019","originalEra":"鎌倉時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"鎌倉","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"北条時宗","cardTitle":"神風の盾・北条時宗","achievementText":"執権として二度の元寇に立ち向かい、日本を守った。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/019.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/019.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"020","originalEra":"室町時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"室町","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"後醍醐天皇","cardTitle":"不屈の帝王・後醍醐天皇","achievementText":"鎌倉幕府を倒し、天皇中心の建武の新政を行った。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/020.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/020.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"021","originalEra":"室町時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"室町","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"足利尊氏","cardTitle":"乱世の風雲児・足利尊氏","achievementText":"京都に室町幕府を開き、初代将軍となった。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/021.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/021.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"022","originalEra":"室町時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"室町","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"足利義満","cardTitle":"黄金の室町殿・足利義満","achievementText":"南北朝を統一し、勘合を用いた日明貿易を始めた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/022.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/022.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"025","originalEra":"戦国時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"戦国","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"織田信長","cardTitle":"第六天魔王・織田信長","achievementText":"楽市・楽座を進め、天下統一を目指したが本能寺で倒れた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/025.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/025.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"026","originalEra":"戦国時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"戦国","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"明智光秀","cardTitle":"三日天下の反逆者・明智光秀","achievementText":"本能寺の変を起こしたが、山崎の戦いで敗れた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/026.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/026.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"027","originalEra":"戦国時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"戦国","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"豊臣秀吉","cardTitle":"出世街道の覇者・豊臣秀吉","achievementText":"天下統一を果たし、太閤検地と刀狩を行った。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/027.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/027.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"028","originalEra":"戦国時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"戦国","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"石田三成","cardTitle":"義に殉じた知将・石田三成","achievementText":"関ヶ原の戦いで西軍を率い、東軍と戦った。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/028.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/028.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"061","originalEra":"鎌倉時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"鎌倉","category":"文化・産業","personName":"法然","cardTitle":"念仏の開祖・法然","achievementText":"『南無阿弥陀仏』と唱える教えを説き、浄土宗を開いた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/061.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/061.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"062","originalEra":"鎌倉時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"鎌倉","category":"文化・産業","personName":"親鸞","cardTitle":"悪人正機の教え・親鸞","achievementText":"阿弥陀仏を信じる教えを説き、浄土真宗を開いた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/062.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/062.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"064","originalEra":"鎌倉時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"鎌倉","category":"文化・産業","personName":"日蓮","cardTitle":"闘う仏教者・日蓮","achievementText":"『南無妙法蓮華経』と唱える教えを説き、日蓮宗を開いた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/064.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/064.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"065","originalEra":"室町時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"室町","category":"文化・産業","personName":"足利義政","cardTitle":"わびさびの体現者・足利義政","achievementText":"銀閣を建て、東山文化が栄える土台をつくった。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/065.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/065.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"067","originalEra":"室町時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"室町","category":"文化・産業","personName":"雪舟","cardTitle":"墨一色の天才・雪舟","achievementText":"明で水墨画を学び、『秋冬山水図』などを描いた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/067.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/067.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"068","originalEra":"戦国時代","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"戦国","category":"文化・産業","personName":"千利休","cardTitle":"茶聖なる完璧主義者・千利休","achievementText":"簡素さを重んじるわび茶を大成した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/068.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/068.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"092","originalEra":"世界史","gameStage":"medieval","gameStageLabel":"中世","drawGroup":"戦国","category":"海外","personName":"フランシスコ・ザビエル","cardTitle":"奇跡の伝来・ザビエル","achievementText":"1549年に鹿児島へ来航し、日本にキリスト教を伝えた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/092.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/092.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"029","originalEra":"江戸時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"江戸","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"徳川家康","cardTitle":"忍耐のタヌキおやじ・徳川家康","achievementText":"関ヶ原の戦いに勝利し、江戸幕府を開いた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/029.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/029.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"030","originalEra":"江戸時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"江戸","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"徳川家光","cardTitle":"生まれながらの将軍・徳川家光","achievementText":"参勤交代を制度化し、鎖国体制を完成させた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/030.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/030.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"031","originalEra":"江戸時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"江戸","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"徳川綱吉","cardTitle":"犬将軍の慈悲・徳川綱吉","achievementText":"生類憐れみの令を出し、生き物を大切にするよう命じた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/031.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/031.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"032","originalEra":"江戸時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"江戸","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"徳川吉宗","cardTitle":"暴れん坊将軍・徳川吉宗","achievementText":"享保の改革を行い、目安箱を設置した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/032.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/032.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"035","originalEra":"幕末","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"幕末","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"井伊直弼","cardTitle":"開国の決断者・井伊直弼","achievementText":"日米修好通商条約を結び、反対派を安政の大獄で処罰した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/035.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/035.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"036","originalEra":"幕末","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"幕末","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"坂本龍馬","cardTitle":"幕末の風雲児・坂本龍馬","achievementText":"薩長同盟の成立を仲介し、船中八策を示した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/036.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/036.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"039","originalEra":"幕末","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"幕末","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"西郷隆盛","cardTitle":"維新の英雄・西郷隆盛","achievementText":"江戸城の無血開城を実現し、のちに西南戦争で戦った。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/039.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/039.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"069","originalEra":"江戸時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"江戸","category":"文化・産業","personName":"松尾芭蕉","cardTitle":"さすらいの俳人・松尾芭蕉","achievementText":"各地を旅して俳諧を高め、『奥の細道』を書いた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/069.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/069.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"071","originalEra":"江戸時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"江戸","category":"文化・産業","personName":"杉田玄白","cardTitle":"西洋医学の扉・杉田玄白","achievementText":"オランダ語の医学書を翻訳し、『解体新書』を出版した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/071.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/071.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"072","originalEra":"江戸時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"江戸","category":"文化・産業","personName":"伊能忠敬","cardTitle":"日本を測った男・伊能忠敬","achievementText":"全国を歩いて測量し、精密な日本地図をつくった。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/072.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/072.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"073","originalEra":"江戸時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"江戸","category":"文化・産業","personName":"本居宣長","cardTitle":"国学の探求者・本居宣長","achievementText":"『古事記伝』を著し、日本古来の考えを研究する国学を大成した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/073.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/073.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"094","originalEra":"世界史","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"幕末","category":"海外","personName":"ペリー","cardTitle":"黒船の衝撃・ペリー","achievementText":"黒船を率いて浦賀に来航し、日米和親条約の締結を求めた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/094.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/094.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"042","originalEra":"明治時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"明治","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"板垣退助","cardTitle":"自由は死せず・板垣退助","achievementText":"自由民権運動を進め、国会開設を求めて自由党を結成した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/042.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/042.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"043","originalEra":"明治時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"明治","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"伊藤博文","cardTitle":"初代総理の威厳・伊藤博文","achievementText":"初代内閣総理大臣となり、大日本帝国憲法の制定を進めた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/043.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/043.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"050","originalEra":"昭和時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"昭和","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"犬養毅","cardTitle":"話せばわかる・犬養毅","achievementText":"首相在任中、五・一五事件で海軍の青年将校らに暗殺された。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/050.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/050.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"052","originalEra":"昭和時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"昭和","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"吉田茂","cardTitle":"復興のワンマン宰相・吉田茂","achievementText":"戦後の首相として復興を進め、サンフランシスコ平和条約に調印した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/052.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/052.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"053","originalEra":"昭和時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"昭和","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"佐藤栄作","cardTitle":"非核三原則の誓い・佐藤栄作","achievementText":"非核三原則を示し、沖縄の日本復帰を実現した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/053.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/053.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"078","originalEra":"明治時代","gameStage":"earlyModernModern","gameStageLabel":"近世・近代","drawGroup":"明治","category":"文化・産業","personName":"渋沢栄一","cardTitle":"資本主義の父・渋沢栄一","achievementText":"銀行や多くの会社の設立に関わり、日本の近代産業を育てた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/078.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/078.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"07